    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH91FB065E7779BA61D78EC5BD69224967" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
This Balancing Authority has no load within its metered boundaries. Therefore, there is no Net Energy for Load to use as a point of reference to determine the integrated net load on plant at the hour of annual peak demand.</div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH68690170408E151216D0AF2599480968" xlink:to="HH91FB065E7779BA61D78EC5BD69224967" order="1" />
